{"seq":6,"slug":"ros2-navigation-stack","title":"ROS 2 导航栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/ros2-advanced/ros2-navigation-stack","wordCount":1260,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ros-2-导航栈\">ROS 2 导航栈</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Nav2（Navigation2）是 ROS 2 的标准导航框架，提供从全局路径规划到局部避障的完整移动机器人导航能力。Nav2 采用行为树（Behavior Tree）作为任务编排引擎，将导航分解为可组合的模块化插件，支持从简单点到点导航到复杂多楼层巡逻的各种场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Nav2 导航栈] --&gt; B[行为树服务器]&#10;    A --&gt; C[全局规划器]&#10;    A --&gt; D[局部控制器]&#10;    A --&gt; E[恢复行为]&#10;    B --&gt; F[NavigateToPose]&#10;    B --&gt; G[NavigateThroughPoses]&#10;    C --&gt; H[NavFn Planner]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Smac Planner]&#10;    D --&gt; J[DWB Controller]&#10;    D --&gt; K[MPPI Controller]&#10;    E --&gt; L[Spin Recovery]&#10;    E --&gt; M[BackUp Recovery]\">graph TD\n    A[Nav2 导航栈] --&gt; B[行为树服务器]\n    A --&gt; C[全局规划器]\n    A --&gt; D[局部控制器]\n    A --&gt; E[恢复行为]\n    B --&gt; F[NavigateToPose]\n    B --&gt; G[NavigateThroughPoses]\n    C --&gt; H[NavFn Planner]\n    C --&gt; I[Smac Planner]\n    D --&gt; J[DWB Controller]\n    D --&gt; K[MPPI Controller]\n    E --&gt; L[Spin Recovery]\n    E --&gt; M[BackUp Recovery]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Nav2 组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>默认插件</th>\n<th>替代插件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局规划器</td>\n<td>计算全局最优路径</td>\n<td>NavFn（A*）</td>\n<td>Smac（Hybrid A*）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部控制器</td>\n<td>跟踪路径并避障</td>\n<td>DWB</td>\n<td>MPPI、RPP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代价地图</td>\n<td>障碍物表征</td>\n<td>Voxel Layer</td>\n<td>自定义层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复行为</td>\n<td>导航失败恢复</td>\n<td>Spin、BackUp</td>\n<td>Wait、自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为树</td>\n<td>任务编排</td>\n<td>XML BT</td>\n<td>自定义树</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代价地图配置\">代价地图配置</h2><p>代价地图是 Nav2 的感知基础——将传感器数据转化为可通行性信息。Nav2 使用分层代价地图架构，每一层负责维护不同来源的障碍物信息，最终合并为一张统一的代价地图。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"global_costmap:&#10;  ros__parameters:&#10;    update_frequency: 1.0&#10;    publish_frequency: 1.0&#10;    global_frame: map&#10;    robot_base_frame: base_link&#10;    resolution: 0.05&#10;    plugins: [&#39;static_layer&#39;, &#39;obstacle_layer&#39;, &#39;inflation_layer&#39;]&#10;    static_layer:&#10;      plugin: &#39;nav2_costmap_2d::StaticLayer&#39;&#10;      map_subscribe_transient_local: true&#10;    obstacle_layer:&#10;      plugin: &#39;nav2_costmap_2d::ObstacleLayer&#39;&#10;      observation_sources: scan&#10;      scan:&#10;        topic: /scan&#10;        max_obstacle_height: 2.0&#10;        clearing: true&#10;        marking: true&#10;    inflation_layer:&#10;      plugin: &#39;nav2_costmap_2d::InflationLayer&#39;&#10;      cost_scaling_factor: 3.0&#10;      inflation_radius: 0.55\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">global_costmap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ros__parameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    update_frequency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    publish_frequency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    global_frame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    robot_base_frame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">base_link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resolution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    plugins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'static_layer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'obstacle_layer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inflation_layer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    static_layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nav2_costmap_2d::StaticLayer'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      map_subscribe_transient_local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    obstacle_layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nav2_costmap_2d::ObstacleLayer'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      observation_sources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      scan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        topic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        max_obstacle_height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        clearing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        marking</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    inflation_layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nav2_costmap_2d::InflationLayer'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      cost_scaling_factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      inflation_radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.55</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代价地图层</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Static Layer</td>\n<td>静态地图</td>\n<td>SLAM 建图</td>\n<td>一次性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Obstacle Layer</td>\n<td>动态障碍物</td>\n<td>激光雷达/深度相机</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inflation Layer</td>\n<td>安全膨胀</td>\n<td>配置参数</td>\n<td>随障碍物更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Voxel Layer</td>\n<td>3D 障碍物</td>\n<td>3D 点云</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inflation Layer 的参数直接影响路径规划行为。<code>inflation_radius</code> 决定了障碍物周围的&quot;安全距离&quot;——在此范围内代价值从致命（254）递减到自由（0）。<code>cost_scaling_factor</code> 控制递减速度：值越大代价衰减越快，规划器倾向于更靠近障碍物行驶；值越小衰减越慢，路径更保守。</p>\n<p>全局代价地图和局部代价地图的区别：全局代价地图覆盖整个已知环境，更新频率较低，用于全局路径规划；局部代价地图以机器人为中心的滑动窗口，高频更新，用于局部避障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路径规划器\">路径规划器</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;nav2_core/global_planner.hpp&gt;&#10;&#10;class CustomPlanner : public nav2_core::GlobalPlanner {&#10;public:&#10;    void configure(&#10;        const rclcpp_lifecycle::LifecycleNode::WeakPtr &amp;parent,&#10;        std::string name,&#10;        std::shared_ptr&lt;tf2_ros::Buffer&gt; tf,&#10;        std::shared_ptr&lt;nav2_costmap_2d::Costmap2DROS&gt; costmap_ros) override {&#10;        node_ = parent.lock();&#10;        costmap_ = costmap_ros-&gt;getCostmap();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    nav_msgs::msg::Path createPlan(&#10;        const geometry_msgs::msg::PoseStamped &amp;start,&#10;        const geometry_msgs::msg::PoseStamped &amp;goal) override {&#10;        nav_msgs::msg::Path path;&#10;        path.header.frame_id = &quot;map&quot;;&#10;        path.header.stamp = node_-&gt;now();&#10;        // A* or custom algorithm&#10;        return path;&#10;    }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;nav2_core/global_planner.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CustomPlanner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> : </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nav2_core</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GlobalPlanner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> configure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rclcpp_lifecycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LifecycleNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WeakPtr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shared_ptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tf2_ros</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shared_ptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nav2_costmap_2d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Costmap2DROS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">costmap_ros</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">override</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        node_ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        costmap_ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> costmap_ros-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCostmap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    nav_msgs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Path</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPlan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> geometry_msgs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PoseStamped</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> geometry_msgs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PoseStamped</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">goal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">override</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        nav_msgs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::Path path;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        path.header.frame_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"map\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        path.header.stamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // A* or custom algorithm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规划器</th>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>路径质量</th>\n<th>计算速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NavFn</td>\n<td>A* / Dijkstra</td>\n<td>全向机器人</td>\n<td>最短路径</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Smac 2D</td>\n<td>A*</td>\n<td>全向机器人</td>\n<td>更平滑</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Smac Hybrid A*</td>\n<td>Hybrid A*</td>\n<td>类车机器人</td>\n<td>满足运动学</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Smac Lattice</td>\n<td>状态格搜索</td>\n<td>复杂运动学</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>NavFn 是最简单的规划器，使用 A* 或 Dijkstra 搜索栅格地图上的最短路径，不考虑机器人的运动学约束——它假设机器人可以向任意方向移动。这对全向移动机器人（如麦克纳姆轮）足够，但对类车机器人（如 Ackermann 转向）会生成不可执行的路径。</p>\n<p>Smac Hybrid A* 在搜索空间中增加了航向角维度，生成的路径天然满足非完整约束（最小转弯半径）。它使用 Dubins 或 Reeds-Shepp 曲线连接路径段，适合叉车、仓库 AGV 等类车机器人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"局部控制器\">局部控制器</h2><p>局部控制器负责沿全局路径行驶并实时避障。DWB（Dynamic Window-Based）是默认控制器，在速度空间中采样可行的速度组合，通过评价函数选择最优速度——平衡路径跟踪、目标趋近和障碍物规避。</p>\n<p>MPPI（Model Predictive Path Integral）控制器是更先进的选择。它通过蒙特卡洛采样大量控制序列，在预测时域内评估每条轨迹的代价，加权平均得到最优控制输入。MPPI 在复杂动态环境中表现更好，但计算量更大。</p>\n<p>RPP（Regulated Pure Pursuit）控制器基于纯追踪算法——沿路径前方设置一个&quot;看点&quot;，计算到达看点所需的转弯曲率。RPP 实现简单、行为可预测，适合低速和窄通道场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行为树编排\">行为树编排</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;root main_tree_to_execute=&quot;MainTree&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;BehaviorTree ID=&quot;MainTree&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;RecoveryNode number_of_retries=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;PipelineSequence&gt;&#10;        &lt;RateController hz=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;ComputePathToPose goal=&quot;{goal}&quot; path=&quot;{path}&quot;&#10;                             planner_id=&quot;GridBased&quot;/&gt;&#10;        &lt;/RateController&gt;&#10;        &lt;FollowPath path=&quot;{path}&quot; controller_id=&quot;FollowPath&quot;/&gt;&#10;      &lt;/PipelineSequence&gt;&#10;      &lt;ReactiveFallback&gt;&#10;        &lt;Spin spin_dist=&quot;1.57&quot;/&gt;&#10;        &lt;BackUp backup_dist=&quot;0.3&quot; backup_speed=&quot;0.05&quot;/&gt;&#10;        &lt;Wait wait_duration=&quot;5&quot;/&gt;&#10;      &lt;/ReactiveFallback&gt;&#10;    &lt;/RecoveryNode&gt;&#10;  &lt;/BehaviorTree&gt;&#10;&lt;/root&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">root</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main_tree_to_execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MainTree\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">BehaviorTree</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MainTree\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">RecoveryNode</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> number_of_retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">PipelineSequence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">RateController</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ComputePathToPose</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> goal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{goal}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{path}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                             planner_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GridBased\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">RateController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">FollowPath</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{path}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> controller_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FollowPath\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">PipelineSequence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ReactiveFallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Spin</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> spin_dist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.57\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">BackUp</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> backup_dist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.3\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> backup_speed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.05\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wait_duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ReactiveFallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">RecoveryNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">BehaviorTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>行为树相比有限状态机（FSM）的优势在于模块化和可组合性。每个节点独立定义行为（条件、动作、控制流），通过树结构组合形成复杂的导航策略。添加新行为只需在树中插入新节点，不需要修改已有逻辑。Nav2 使用 BehaviorTree.CPP 库，行为树定义在 XML 文件中，可以在运行时动态加载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Nav2 是 ROS 2 的标准导航框架，采用行为树编排实现模块化和可扩展的导航任务</li>\n<li>代价地图通过分层架构（静态层 + 障碍物层 + 膨胀层）表征环境中的障碍物和可通行区域</li>\n<li>Inflation Layer 的参数直接控制路径与障碍物的距离，需要根据机器人尺寸仔细调参</li>\n<li>全局规划器计算最优路径，局部控制器负责路径跟踪和动态避障</li>\n<li>Smac 规划器系列（2D / Hybrid A* / Lattice）覆盖从全向到非完整约束的各种机器人</li>\n<li>MPPI 控制器在复杂动态环境中优于传统 DWB，但计算量更大</li>\n<li>行为树的恢复节点机制使机器人能够在导航失败时自动执行旋转、后退等恢复动作</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ROS 2 导航栈","id":"ros-2-导航栈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代价地图配置","id":"代价地图配置"},{"level":2,"text":"路径规划器","id":"路径规划器"},{"level":2,"text":"局部控制器","id":"局部控制器"},{"level":2,"text":"行为树编排","id":"行为树编排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ROS 2 QoS 策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/ros2-advanced/qos-policies"},"next":{"title":"DDS 与实时通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/communication-protocols/dds-realtime"}}